  "question": {
    "text": "The length of the portion of the common tangent to <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math> and <math><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>225</mn></math>&nbsp;between the two points of contact is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
